# NLLoc template of the example model: yanll fills the three LOCFILES paths and the
# @CORRECTIONS@ line (INCLUDE of corrections.in, commented out when the input says
# station_corrections false). The location grid is 120 km wide and 40 km deep around the
# origin of the TRANS projection, searched with the octree.
CONTROL 1 54321
TRANS SIMPLE 45.0 10.0 0.0
LOCSIG yanll example
LOCCOM synthetic 1D model, six stations
LOCFILES @OBS@ NLLOC_OBS @TIME@ @OUT@
LOCHYPOUT SAVE_NLLOC_ALL
LOCSEARCH OCT 12 12 8 0.01 20000 5000 0 1
LOCGRID 121 121 41 -60.0 -60.0 -2.0 1.0 1.0 1.0 PROB_DENSITY SAVE
LOCMETH EDT_OT_WT 9999.0 4 -1 -1 -1 -1 -1.0 1
LOCGAU 0.2 0.0
LOCGAU2 0.01 0.05 2.0
LOCPHASEID P P p G PN Pn PG Pg
LOCPHASEID S S s G SN Sn SG Sg
LOCQUAL2ERR 0.05 0.1 0.2 0.5 99999.9
@CORRECTIONS@
